					"name": "Protect/Jinx",
					"local_notes": "Lore: The same Rune worked as a shield for an ally, or a curse that strips an enemy's own defences thin.\n\nDesign: Alternative_abilities container; full price for the costlier Jinx plus a fifth of the cheaper Protect.",
