							"local_notes": "Lore: A brief, hardening ward of psychic force over a willing ally, thickening their guard for a few crucial seconds.\n\nDesign: Affliction (10) delivering a +10 point DR-boosting advantage, Warp Sorcery (-20%), Perils (Aeldari Runes, -5%). Net -15%. Full modified cost: 8.5, rounded to 8 points (discounted to a fifth as the cheaper alternative ability); needs Aeldari Warp Empowerment level 1 (cap 20) at its full-price rate.",
